      "description": "SANDY BEAUTY HAVEN – TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS\n\n1. Appointments &amp; Deposits\n\n• All appointments require a non-refundable deposit to secure your booking.\n• Your deposit is deducted from the total cost of your treatment.\n• Appointments are not confirmed until the deposit has been paid.\n\n2. Cancellations &amp; Rescheduling\n\n• You must give at least 48 hours’ notice to cancel or reschedule your appointment.\n• Cancellations or reschedules made within 48 hours will forfeit your deposit.\n• Same-day cancellations or failure to attend will be charged 100% of the service cost.\n\n3. Late Arrivals\n\n• Please arrive on time to your appointment.\n• If you are more than 10 minutes late, your appointment may be cancelled and your deposit forfeited.\n• If I am able to proceed, your treatment time may be shortened to avoid affecting the next client.\n\n4. No-Shows\n\n• Failure to attend your appointment without notice is considered a no-show.\n• No-shows will be required to pay in full upfront for any future bookings.\n\n5. Refills &amp; Foreign Work\n\n• Refills are only accepted on work done by Sandy Beauty Haven unless otherwise agreed.\n• Lashes done by another technician will be charged as a full set or removal + full set.\n• You must book the correct service. If you book the wrong one, your appointment may be cancelled and deposit lost.\n\n6. Refund Policy\n\n• No refunds are offered on any services.\n• If you are unhappy, please contact us within 48 hours and we will assess if a complimentary fix is appropriate.\n• Fixes are at the technician’s discretion and must be booked within 3 days.\n\n7. Patch Tests &amp; Allergies\n\n• It is your responsibility to inform us of any allergies, sensitivities, medical conditions, or eye conditions before your appointment.\n• Patch tests are recommended for new clients or those with sensitive skin.\n• Sandy Beauty Haven will not be held responsible for reactions where the client has failed to disclose relevant information.\n\n8. Aftercare &amp; Responsibility\n\n• Proper aftercare instructions will be given and must be followed.\n• We are not responsible for poor retention or issues caused by:\n\t•\tOily skin\n\t•\tHormones\n\t•\tMedication\n\t•\tSleeping habits\n\t•\tNot following aftercare\n\t•\tPicking or rubbing lashes\n\n\n9. Children, Guests &amp; Phones\n\n• No extra guests or children are allowed unless agreed beforehand.\n• Please keep phone use minimal during your treatment.\n\n10. Right to Refuse Service\n\n• Sandy Beauty Haven reserves the right to refuse service to anyone who:\n\t•\tIs rude, aggressive, or inappropriate\n\t•\tHas contraindications making treatment unsafe\n\t•\tRepeatedly cancels, reschedules, or no-shows\n\n11. Agreement\n\nBy booking an appointment with Sandy Beauty Haven, you confirm that:\n• You have read and understood these Terms &amp; Conditions\n• You agree to all policies stated above\n",
